      <marc:subfield code="a">The Baby Shakespeare video is a visual and auditory field trip using the rhythm of poetry and the beauty of nature to teach words in context. Bard, the word-loving dragon, leads a parade of words, poems, puppet shows, and music videos. World of Poetry presents babies and toddlers with 12 common words that can be found within the rich context of classic poems and the beauty of nature with glorious music of Ludwig van Beethoven</marc:subfield>
